<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main id="main" class="container py-5">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <h1 class="section-title display-6">About Us</h1>
        <p class="mt-3">Our Ethiopian restaurant brings the rich flavors, traditions, and culture of Ethiopia to our community. We serve authentic Ethiopian dishes made with fresh ingredients, flavorful spices, and traditional cooking methods. From our delicious injera to our variety of savory dishes, we want every meal to feel special and welcoming. Our goal is to give guests a chance to enjoy great food while experiencing a small taste of Ethiopian culture and hospitality.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <img src="<%= aboutImage %>" class="img-fluid rounded-4 shadow" alt="Ethiopian stews served on injera">
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
